      "message": "we have some components/libraries, like os-brick, which are part of more containers. For example os-brick is technically part of the cinder project on opendev.org and it follows the same schedule. Should we need a separate entry for it? But then it is also included in other containers, so it should trigger their rebuilds too?\n\nAnother example are the various python-*client which may be included in multiple containers.",
